1
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:08,020
Six... Seven... Eight...

2
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:13,860
Nine... Ten... Eleven...

3
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,410
I'll hide here for now...

4
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:21,160
Sorry, I'll go somewhere else.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,250
Not now.

6
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:29,130
The cops'll get you.

7
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:38,970
Oh no!

8
00:00:40,810 --> 00:00:42,640
The scent of his shampoo

9
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:47,150
mixed with a touch of sweat

10
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,320
set my heart aflutter.

11
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:58,580
Yoshioka-san, stay and hide.

12
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:02,080
I knew there was a robber here!

13
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,040
Get him!

14
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:05,210
Don't let him escape!

15
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:09,170
They caught him...

16
00:01:09,710 --> 00:01:11,340
It's my fault.

17
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:15,470
I've gotta free him!

18
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:39,660
Hey...

19
00:01:41,740 --> 00:01:43,330
Thanks.

20
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,380
I can't go back...

21
00:01:50,630 --> 00:01:51,920
...to those days.

