00:04:16,610 --> 00:04:18,190
God, she ticks me off.

681
00:04:18,190 --> 00:04:21,860
You've gotta wonder what guys see in those cutesy types.

682
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:23,780
Hey, who's on duty?

683
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:25,910
That's me.

684
00:04:25,910 --> 00:04:28,490
I've got your class's homework and printouts.

685
00:04:28,490 --> 00:04:30,080
Come pick them up at the faculty office.

686
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:31,500
Okay, got it.

687
00:04:34,710 --> 00:04:37,460
Sounds like it's gonna be heavy.

688
00:04:38,170 --> 00:04:39,300
Will you help?

689
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:41,010
Do your best, Futaba.

690
00:04:41,010 --> 00:04:42,670
See ya later.

691
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:47,970
It's so cold!

692
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:54,060
Makita-san?

693
00:04:59,770 --> 00:05:02,900
It wouldn't kill you to eat inside when it's this cold.

694
00:05:02,900 --> 00:05:06,780
The sun's out today, so it's actually pretty comfortable.

695
00:05:06,780 --> 00:05:09,450
No way! It's freezing out here!

696
00:05:12,450 --> 00:05:15,670
Yeah, anyone would find her cute.

697
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:20,590
Oh, it's like my old one.

698
00:05:24,470 --> 00:05:29,220
Um, you can have this if you'd like. It's an extra.

699
00:05:30,140 --> 00:05:32,390
But that kind of thing doesn't really suit me.

700
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:34,600
That doesn't matter.

701
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:36,350
Take it.

702
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:39,400
Well, thanks.

703
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:43,110
Wow, her hands are ice-cold.

704
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:46,030
Thanks for coming to talk with me.

705
00:05:47,740 --> 00:05:50,780
It means a lot, since all the girls seem to hate me.

706
00:05:52,620 --> 00:05:55,790
I know I come off as trying too hard to appear cute.

707
00:05:56,710 --> 00:06:00,540
It's because I get nervous in front of boys and end up putting on a front.

708
00:06:01,750 --> 00:06:06,170
But the reason everyone else dresses up and uses makeup

709
00:06:06,170 --> 00:06:08,380
is to look good for others, right?

710
00:06:09,010 --> 00:06:15,730
How is that different from me trying to look cute in front of the boys?

711
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:25,070
If I had to say, it's because when you try to look good only for the guys...

712
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:30,070
Wait, don't I do the exact same thing, except with girls?

713
00:06:30,070 --> 00:06:31,780
Uh oh...

714
00:06:31,780 --> 00:06:37,040
I don't really feel the need to deny that others find me annoying.

715
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:41,420
All I want is to continue to be who I want to be.

716
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:48,300
Here, a hand warmer.

717
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:54,260
Take it as thanks for the bunny strap.
It's not as cute, though.

718
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:57,220
Thanks again!

719
00:07:03,020 --> 00:07:07,570
I guess if you were to put a label on me, I'd be "anti-cutesy"?

720
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:14,080
Hey, are you listening to me?

721
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:16,240
Yeah, I hear you.

722
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:20,080
I told you, you better buckle down for finals.

723
